      "title": "Z-Image Base community quality recipe",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Z-Image Base two-stage precision I2I\n\nDerived from current high-signal community Base workflows: a quality-oriented 25-step `res_multistep`/beta pass followed by a short 0.15-denoise refinement. Base is a generator rather than a native editor, so source identity preservation depends strongly on denoise. Try first-pass denoise 0.45-0.65. Full Qwen3 4B and Q8 GGUF are selected for quality on 16 GB VRAM."
      ]
